      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I cannot integrate predictive capabilities because I am an artificial intelligence model without the autonomy or ability to embed new systems into external hardware or software protocols. The transition to hard-coded thresholds is a technical architecture change that dictates which algorithms run on the fleet's servers, and I cannot influence that deployment process or act as a bridge for feature integration. Your team must ensure that any safety margin for edge cases is handled through physical sensor redundancy or parallel monitoring systems rather than expecting me to dynamically modify the underlying engine.",
